{"3617510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drone Armada", "steam_appid": 3617510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kaelisia is being consumed sector by sector. The Stato Front is advancing, and every mission is vital to hold the line, recover critical resources, and push the invasion back.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617510/extras/6bf24fcbb5ce10b7e9c9d1bf63ec3cb4.poster.avif?t=1780925594\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617510/extras/6bf24fcbb5ce10b7e9c9d1bf63ec3cb4.webm?t=1780925594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enlist as an elite pilot in Drone Armada, and command massive drone swarms in real-time action-strategy battles. Lead your primary swarm into combat, direct supporting units across the battlefield, research powerful technologies, upgrade your fleet, and adapt your tactics before the  enemy overwhelms the front.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the ranks, dominate the battlefield, and rise as the legendary Drone Commander who turned the tide - reclaiming Kaelisia one mission at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617510/extras/311eca09aaa8d60da601b942ce4f658e.webp?t=1780925594\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617510/extras/a2d1db9733c7c01fefa4320efe380620.poster.avif?t=1780925594\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617510/extras/a2d1db9733c7c01fefa4320efe380620.webm?t=1780925594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of fast-moving drone swarms and turn battlefield chaos into coordinated firepower. Shift formations, redirect attacks, trigger abilities, and reposition your forces as threats change around you.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pilot your primary swarm</strong> through intense real-time battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Command supporting swarms</strong> to flank, defend, intercept, or focus fire.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt formations on the fly</strong> to survive different enemy threats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use tactical abilities</strong> to shield, boost, target, and overwhelm.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617510/extras/311eca09aaa8d60da601b942ce4f658e.webp?t=1780925594\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617510/extras/2d826eff2a0d7f9dc8e2feddf81a7005.poster.avif?t=1780925594\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617510/extras/2d826eff2a0d7f9dc8e2feddf81a7005.webm?t=1780925594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way across a world under invasion through campaign missions, optional operations, and escalating threats. Each region introduces new battlefield conditions, enemies, and opportunities to strengthen your armada.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advance through a full story campaign</strong> against the Stato Front.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete optional operations</strong> to uncover resources, allies, upgrades, and intel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt between missions</strong> as the invasion spreads and the pressure rises.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE THE DEEP FRONT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your armada is ready, push beyond the main campaign into a high-risk roguelite operation. Enter enemy-held territory, survive escalating encounters, and recover rare resources for powerful late-game upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the greater the rewards — but only a prepared swarm will make it back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617510/extras/311eca09aaa8d60da601b942ce4f658e.webp?t=1780925594\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617510/extras/1c633a1d11bbbcdb6dc5eb2673cb0f7b.poster.avif?t=1780925594\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617510/extras/1c633a1d11bbbcdb6dc5eb2673cb0f7b.webm?t=1780925594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recover resources and intel to expand your drone fleet between missions. Research powerful tech, upgrade your units, and build a swarm that matches the way you want to fight.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your fleet</strong> with stronger weapons, better defences, sensors, and mobility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deploy specialised drone types</strong>, from agile scouts to heavy assault units.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape your strategy</strong> around speed, durability, precision, or overwhelming force.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kaelisia is being consumed sector by sector. The Stato Front is advancing, and every mission is vital to hold the line, recover critical resources, and push the invasion back.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617510/extras/6bf24fcbb5ce10b7e9c9d1bf63ec3cb4.poster.avif?t=1780925594\" width=616 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617510/extras/6bf24fcbb5ce10b7e9c9d1bf63ec3cb4.webm?t=1780925594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enlist as an elite pilot in Drone Armada, and command massive drone swarms in real-time action-strategy battles. Lead your primary swarm into combat, direct supporting units across the battlefield, research powerful technologies, upgrade your fleet, and adapt your tactics before the  enemy overwhelms the front.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the ranks, dominate the battlefield, and rise as the legendary Drone Commander who turned the tide - reclaiming Kaelisia one mission at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\